Find the least-squares solution
\begin{equation}
\hat{Y}=argmin_{Y}\parallel B^{(R)}-A^{(R)}\hat{U}Y||_F.
\end{equation}
If $rank(A^{(R)}\hat{U})=r$ we can write $\hat{Y}$ in closed form
as before:
\begin{equation}
\hat{Y}=[\hat{U}^{T}A^{(R)^{T}}A^{(R)}\hat{U}]^{-1}\hat{U}^{T}A^{(R)^{T}}B^{(R)}. \end{equation}
